#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1864-6
msgid "Night Mode"
msgstr "Nočný režim"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1866-6
msgid ""
"While setting the warm light percentages for different intervals, you can "
"also set that interval to <span class=\"ui\">Night Mode</span>, which "
"inverts the screen colors when that interval starts. If your minimum "
"frontlight is still too bright or if you prefer a dark page background, you "
"can activate this feature. To enable this, in the dialog below, tap the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Night mode</span> checkbox and tap <span "
"class=\"ui\">Set</span>."
msgstr ""
"Pri nastavovaní percent farebného tepla svetla pre rôzne intervaly môžete "
"nastaviť aj tento interval na <span class=\"ui\">Nočný režim</span>, ktorý "
"invertuje farby obrazovky, keď tento interval začne. Ak je vaše minimálne "
"predné svetlo stále príliš jasné alebo ak uprednostňujete tmavé pozadie "
"strany, môžete túto funkciu aktivovať. Ak to chcete povoliť, v dialógovom "
"okne nižšie ťuknite na zaškrtávacie políčko <span class=\"ui\">Nočný režim</"
"span> a ťuknite <span class=\"ui\">Nastaviť</span>."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1869-6
msgid ""
"When you do this, a <b>moon icon</b> will appear in the menu next to this "
"interval. To disable night mode, just disable the <span class=\"ui\">Night "
"mode</span> checkbox in that interval."
msgstr ""
"Keď to urobíte, v ponuke vedľa tohto intervalu sa zobrazí <b>ikona mesiaca</"
"b>. Ak chcete vypnúť nočný režim, jednoducho odznačte zaškrtávacie políčko "
"<span class=\"ui\">Nočný režim</span> v tomto intervale."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1875-6
msgid "Frontlight auto on/off"
msgstr "Automatické podsvietenie zap/vyp"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1877-6
msgid ""
"This feature turns your frontlight on at sunset and turns it off at sunrise "
"according to your <span class=\"ui\">Currently active parameters</span> in "
"this plugin. You can override this change by manually turning your "
"frontlight on/off. On the next sunrise/sunset, <span "
"class=\"ui\">AutoWarmth</span> will toggle it again if it is necessary. You "
"can activate it by selecting <span class=\"ui\">Frontlight off during the "
"day</span> menu item in this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Táto funkcia zapne vaše podsvietenie pri západe slnka a vypne ho pri východe "
"slnka podľa vašich <span class=\"ui\">Aktuálne aktívnych parametrov</span> v "
"tomto doplnku. Túto zmenu môžete prepísať manuálnym zapnutím/vypnutím "
"podsvietenia. Pri ďalšom východe/západe slnka, to funkcia <span "
"class=\"ui\">Automatická farebná teplota</span> v prípade potreby znova "
"prepne. Môžete to aktivovať výberom položky menu <span "
"class=\"ui\">Podsvietenie je cez deň vypnuté</span> v tomto doplnku."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1882-6
msgid "Faster warmth transitions"
msgstr "Rýchlejšie prechody pre farebnú teplotu"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1884-6
msgid ""
"If you want your frontlight warmth to change quickly instead of a more "
"gradual change:"
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete, aby sa farebná teplota podsvietenia menila rýchlo namiesto "
"postupnej zmeny:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1886-7
msgid "Set the mode to <b>Fixed schedule</b> following the instructions above"
msgstr "Nastavte režim na <b>Pevný harmonogram</b> podľa pokynov vyššie"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1888-7
msgid "And adjust the settings similar to the image below:"
msgstr "A upravte nastavenia podobne ako na obrázku nižšie:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1893-6
msgid ""
"As you can see in these settings above, there is only a one minute "
"difference between day-night transition. So the screen warmth goes from <b>0 "
"to 100 (or reverse) in only one minute</b>. You can increase this time "
"separation to make the transition duration longer."
msgstr ""
"Ako vidíte v týchto nastaveniach vyššie, medzi prechodom dňa a noci je "
"rozdiel iba jednej minúty. Takže farebná teplota obrazovky sa zmení z <b>0 "
"na 100 (alebo naopak) za iba jednu minútu</b>. Tento časový odstup môžete "
"predĺžiť, aby sa prechod predĺžil."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1901-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "LEARNING THE USER INTERFACE"
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-userinterface"
msgid "3 LEARNING THE USER INTERFACE"
msgstr "ZOZNÁMENIE SA S POUŽÍVATEĽSKÝM ROZHRANÍM"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1903-6
msgid ""
"KOReader has a simple, mainly black and white user interface because "
"gradients and different shades of gray can cause flashing and ghosting on e-"
"ink screens which can degrade reading experience."
msgstr ""
"KOReader má jednoduché, prevažne čiernobiele používateľské rozhranie, "
"pretože prechody a rôzne odtiene šedej môžu na obrazovkách s elektronickým "
"atramentom spôsobiť blikanie a duchov, čo môže zhoršiť zážitok z čítania."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1905-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "KOReader has 2 main interfaces: <span class=\"ui\">reading screen</span> "
#| "and <span class=\"ui\">file browser</span>. We will explain <span "
#| "class=\"ui\">reading screen</span> here. <span class=\"ui\">File browser</"
#| "span> is explained under <a href=\"#L2-filebrowser\">this section</a> of "
#| "the guide."
msgid ""
"KOReader has 2 main interfaces: <span class=\"ui\">reading screen</span> and "
"<span class=\"ui\">file browser</span>. We will explain <span "
"class=\"ui\">reading screen</span> here. <span class=\"ui\">File browser</"
"span> is explained in <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-filebrowser\">this "
"section</a> of the guide."
msgstr ""
"KOReader má 2 hlavné rozhrania: <span class=\"ui\">obrazovku na čítanie</"
"span> a <span class=\"ui\">prehliadač súborov</span>. Vysvetlíme si <span "
"class=\"ui\">obrazovku na čítanie</span> tu. <span class=\"ui\">Prehliadač "
"súborov</span> je vysvetlený v <a href=\"#L2-filebrowser\">tejto časti</a> "
"sprievodcu."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1911-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Reading Screen"
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-readingscreen"
msgid "3.1 Reading Screen"
msgstr "Obrazovka na čítanie"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1913-6
msgid "<b>READING SCREEN</b> has two menus:"
msgstr "<b>OBRAZOVKA NA ČÍTANIE</b> má dve ponuky:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1917-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">TOP MENU</span> includes menu items related to the "
"general usage of KOReader. You will access your books, KOReader preferences, "
"plugins etc. here."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">VRCHNÉ MENU</span> obsahuje položky ponuky súvisiace zo "
"všeobecným používaním KOReaderu. Tu budete mať prístup k svojim knihám, "
"nastaveniam KOReaderu, doplnkom atď."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1919-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">BOTTOM MENU</span> is focused on options for <b>document "
"formatting</b> like font weight/size, line spacing etc. While adjusting your "
"text appearance, you will mostly interact with the <span class=\"ui\">BOTTOM "
"MENU</span>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">SPODNÉ MENU</span> sa zameriava na možnosti "
"<b>formátovania dokumentu</b>, ako je hrúbka/veľkosť písma, riadkovanie atď. "
"Pri úprave vzhľadu textu budete väčšinou pracovať so <span "
"class=\"ui\">SPODNÝM MENU</span>."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1928-6
msgid ""
"Image above shows the elements you can see on your reader screen when "
"reading a book:"
msgstr ""
"Obrázok vyššie zobrazuje prvky, ktoré vidíte na obrazovke čítania pri čítaní "
"knihy:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1930-7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<b>Indicator icons:</b> These icons inform you about certain ongoing "
#| "processes and states. You will see them at the top left corner of your "
#| "screen during certain operations. Normally they are smaller but here we "
#| "show them bigger for clarity. Next heading explains these indicator icons "
#| "in detail: <a href=\"#L2-indicators\">Indicator icons</a>"
msgid ""
"<b>Indicator icons:</b> These icons inform you about certain ongoing "
"processes and states. You will see them at the top left corner of your "
"screen during certain operations. Normally they are smaller but here we show "
"them bigger for clarity. Next heading explains these indicator icons in "
"detail: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-indicators\">Indicator icons</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Ikony indikátorov:</b> Tieto ikony vás informujú o určitých "
"prebiehajúcich procesoch a stavoch. Uvidíte ich v ľavom hornom rohu "
"obrazovky počas určitých operácií. Normálne sú menšie, ale tu ich pre lepšiu "
"prehľadnosť zobrazujeme väčšie. Nasledujúci nadpis podrobne vysvetľuje tieto "
"ikony indikátorov: <a href=\"#L2-indicators\">Ikony indikátorov</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1932-7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<b>Status bar:</b>This is a highly configurable area where you can see "
#| "various information about your book and KOReader. Click here to go to the "
#| "section: <a href=\"#L2-statusbar\">Status bar</a>"
msgid ""
"<b>Status bar:</b>This is a highly configurable area where you can see "
"various information about your book and KOReader. Click here to go to the "
"section: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-statusbar\">Status bar</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Stavový riadok:</b>Toto je vysoko konfigurovateľná oblasť, kde si môžete "
"pozrieť rôzne informácie o svojej knihe a KOReaderi. Kliknite sem pre "
"prechod do sekcie: <a href=\"#L2-statusbar\">Stavový riadok</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1933-7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<b>Alternate Status bar:</b> In addition to the default <span "
#| "class=\"ui\">Status bar</span>, we have an <span class=\"ui\">Alt status "
#| "bar</span> which appears at the top of the page if you enable it. Click "
#| "here for details: <a href=\"#L2-statusbar\">Status bar</a>"
msgid ""
"<b>Alternate Status bar:</b> In addition to the default <span "
"class=\"ui\">Status bar</span>, we have an <span class=\"ui\">Alt status "
"bar</span> which appears at the top of the page if you enable it. Click here "
"for details: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-statusbar\">Status bar</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Alternatívny stavový riadok:</b> Okrem predvoleného <span "
"class=\"ui\">stavového riadka</span> máme aj <span class=\"ui\">alternatívny "
"stavový riadok</span>, ktorý sa zobrazí v hornej časti strany, ak ho "
"povolíte. Kliknite sem pre podrobnosti: <a href=\"#L2-statusbar\">Stavový "
"riadok</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1936-7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<b>Reference page numbers:</b> If the publisher of your book included the "
#| "page numbers from the paper printed version of the book, you will see "
#| "them like this. Click here for more info: <a href=\"#L3-"
#| "referencepages\">Page numbering and reference page numbers</a>"
msgid ""
"<b>Publisher page numbers:</b> If the publisher of your book included the "
"page numbers from the paper printed version of the book, you will see them "
"like this. Click here for more info about <b>publisher page numbers</b>: <a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-pagenumbering\">Page Numbering</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Čísla referenčných strán:</b> Ak vydavateľ vašej knihy zahrnul čísla "
"strán z tlačenej verzie knihy, uvidíte ich takto. Kliknite sem pre viac "
"informácií: <a href=\"#L3-referencepages\">Číslovanie strán a čísla "
"referenčných strán</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1938-7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<b>Highlight types:</b> You can see the different highlight types here. "
#| "Also you can make colored highlights if your device has a suitable "
#| "screen. Click here to go to the section: <a href=\"#L1-"
#| "bookmarks\">Bookmarks, Highlighting and Notes</a>"
msgid ""
"<b>Highlight types:</b> You can see the different highlight types here. Also "
"you can make colored highlights if your device has a suitable screen. Click "
"here to go to the section: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L1-"
"annotating\">Bookmarks, Highlighting and Notes</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Typy zvýraznení:</b> Rôzne typy zvýraznení si môžete pozrieť tu. Ak má "
"vaše zariadenie vhodnú obrazovku, môžete tiež vytvoriť farebné zvýraznenia. "
"Kliknite sem a prejdete do sekcie: <a href=\"#L1-bookmarks\">Záložky, "
"zvýraznenie a poznámky</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1940-7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<b>Note marker:</b> Note marker icon shows up when you add a note to a "
#| "highlight. We have different types of note markers. Click here for more "
#| "info: <a href=\"#L1-bookmarks\">Bookmarks, Highlighting and Notes</a>"
msgid ""
"<b>Note marker:</b> Note marker icon shows up when you add a note to a "
"highlight. We have different types of note markers. Click here for more "
"info: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L1-annotating\">Bookmarks, "
"Highlighting and Notes</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Značka poznámky:</b> Ikona značky poznámky sa zobrazí, keď pridáte "
"poznámku k zvýrazneniu. Máme rôzne typy značiek poznámok. Kliknite sem pre "
"viac informácií: <a href=\"#L1-bookmarks\">Záložky, zvýraznenie a poznámky</"
"a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1944-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Indicator icons"
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-indicators"
msgid "3.2 Indicator icons"
msgstr "Ikony indikátorov"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1946-6
msgid ""
"KOReader has some indicators to inform you about certain ongoing processes "
"and states as you can see in the image above. You will see them at the top "
"left corner of your screen during certain operations."
msgstr ""
"KOReader má niekoľko indikátorov, ktoré vás informujú o určitých "
"prebiehajúcich procesoch a stavoch, ako môžete vidieť na obrázku vyššie. "
"Uvidíte ich v ľavom hornom rohu obrazovky počas určitých operácií."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1951-12
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"label_orange\">Partial rendering icons</span> This group of "
#| "icons belong to the partial rendering procedure and probably you will see "
#| "these icons more frequently than the others. You see these icons when you "
#| "change the settings on the <span class=\"ui\">bottom menu</span>."
msgid ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">Partial rendering icons</span> This group of icons "
"belong to the partial rendering procedure and probably you will see these "
"icons more frequently than the others. You see these icons when you change "
"the settings on the <span class=\"ui\">bottom menu</span>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_orange\">Ikony čiastočného vykresľovania</span> Táto "
"skupina ikon patrí do postupu čiastočného vykresľovania a pravdepodobne sa s "
"nimi budete stretávať častejšie ako s ostatnými. Tieto ikony uvidíte, keď "
"zmeníte nastavenia v <span class=\"ui\">spodnom menu</span>."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1954-8
msgid ""
"This feature, allows you to preview the text appearance adjustments much "
"quicker by only rendering the current chapter instead of the whole book. "
"Also rotating your screen orientation is now much faster thanks to this "
"feature. This feature is <b>ENABLED</b> by default. If necessary, it can be "
"disabled per book (with a tap), or globally (with a long-tap) on:"
msgstr ""
"Táto funkcia vám umožňuje oveľa rýchlejšie zobraziť ukážku úprav vzhľadu "
"textu tým, že sa zobrazí iba aktuálna kapitola namiesto celej knihy. Vďaka "
"tejto funkcii je teraz oveľa rýchlejšie aj otáčanie orientácie obrazovky. "
"Táto funkcia je predvolene <b>POVOLENÁ</b>. V prípade potreby ju možno "
"zakázať pre jednotlivé knihy (ťuknutím) alebo globálne (dlhým podržaním) na:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.div:1957-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:24px;\"> / Document / Enable partial renderings"
msgstr ""
"VRCHNÉ MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Dokument / Povoliť čiastočné vykresľovanie"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1960-8
msgid ""
"After confirming your changes whole book has to be re-rendered so this is a "
"multi-step procedure. These icons shows the stage of rendering as explained "
"below:"
msgstr ""
"Po potvrdení zmien je potrebné celú knihu znova vykresliť, takže ide o viac-"
"krokový postup. Tieto ikony zobrazujú fázu vykresľovania, ako je vysvetlené "
"nižšie:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1967-12
msgid ""
"In this stage, document is <b>partially</b> rendered. Page count, footer "
"info and many things are <b>innacurate</b>. You can see how the new settings "
"look and adjust further. You can also turn pages, jump links in this state."
msgstr ""
"V tejto fáze je dokument <b>čiastočne</b> vykreslený. Počet strán, "
"informácie o päte a mnohé iné sú <b>nepresné</b>. Môžete vidieť, ako "
"vyzerajú nové nastavenia, a môžete ich ďalej upravovať. V tomto stave môžete "
"tiež otáčať strany, preskakovať odkazy."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1972-12
msgid ""
"A full rendering is happening in the <b>background</b>. You can still turn "
"pages, jump links, change settings."
msgstr ""
"Na <b>pozadí</b> prebieha úplné vykreslenie. Stále môžete otáčať strany, "
"preskakovať odkazy, meniť nastavenia."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1976-12
msgid ""
"Full rendering is done, but <b>not yet applied</b> because KOReader is "
"waiting for you to be <b>idle</b> to reload the rest of the book (idle=not "
"interacting with the device). You can still turn pages, jump links, change "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Úplné vykreslenie je hotové, ale <b>zatiaľ sa nepoužije</b>, pretože "
"KOReader čaká, kým budete <b>nečinný</b>, aby ste mohli znova načítať zvyšok "
"knihy (nečinný = bez interakcie so zariadením). Stále môžete otáčať strany, "
"preskakovať odkazy, meniť nastavenia."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1982-12
msgid ""
"You've been idle for a while so KOReader is now reloading the whole "
"document. At this step KOReader is <b>blocked</b> to prevent interaction."
msgstr ""
"Boli ste chvíľu nečinní, takže KOReader teraz znova načítava celý dokument. "
"V tomto kroku je KOReader <b>zablokovaný</b>, aby sa zabránilo interakcii."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1987-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"label_blue\">INFO</span> Partial rendering is only possible "
#| "if your EPUB is composed of multiple fragments. EPUB files are "
#| "basically .zip archives that contain .html files. Some books can be a "
#| "single .html file while others may be composed of multiple .html files "
#| "like each chapter of the book is a separate .html file. <b>If your book "
#| "is only a single .html file, partial rendering can not work, because for "
#| "each change KOReader still has to calculate the whole book.</b>"
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"Partial rendering is only possible if your EPUB is composed of multiple "
"fragments. EPUB files are basically .zip archives that contain .html files. "
"Some books can be a single .html file while others may be composed of "
"multiple .html files like each chapter of the book is a separate .html file. "
"<b>If your book is only a single .html file, partial rendering can not work, "
"because for each change KOReader still has to calculate the whole book.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_blue\">INFORMÁCIA</span> Toto je možné len vtedy, ak sa "
"váš súbor EPUB skladá z viacerých častí. Súbory EPUB sú v podstate "
"archívy .zip, ktoré obsahujú súbory .html. Niektoré knihy môžu byť jedným "
"súborom .html, zatiaľ čo iné môžu byť zložené z viacerých súborov .html, "
"napríklad každá kapitola knihy je samostatný súbor .html. <b>Ak je vaša "
"kniha iba jedným súborom .html, čiastočné vykreslenie nemôže fungovať, "
"pretože pri každej zmene musí KOReader vypočítať celú knihu.</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1995-12
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"label_orange\">Highlighting icon</span> This icon shows up "
#| "when you are in the <span class=\"ui\">Select and highlight mode</span>. "
#| "KOReader has an additional highlight mode which allows you to start a "
#| "highlight and turn pages to make long highlights which can span multiple "
#| "pages. You can read about this in the <a href=\"#bookmarks\">BOOKMARKS, "
#| "HIGHLIGHTING AND NOTES</a> section of this guide. When you start a "
#| "highlight in this mode, this icon is shown at the corner to remind you "
#| "that you are still in the highlighting mode. It disappears when you "
#| "finish your highlight by <b>selecting the end of the passage</b> or when "
#| "you <b>cancel the highlight</b> (by tapping again on the beginning of "
#| "your highlight or on this <span class=\"ui\">highlighting icon</span>)."
msgid ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">Highlighting icon</span> This icon shows up when "
"you are in the <span class=\"ui\">Select and highlight mode</span>. KOReader "
"has an additional highlight mode which allows you to start a highlight and "
"turn pages to make long highlights which can span multiple pages. You can "
"read about this in the <a class=\"internalink\" "
"href=\"#bookmarks\">BOOKMARKS, HIGHLIGHTING AND NOTES</a> section of this "
"guide. When you start a highlight in this mode, this icon is shown at the "
"corner to remind you that you are still in the highlighting mode. It "
"disappears when you finish your highlight by <b>selecting the end of the "
"passage</b> or when you <b>cancel the highlight</b> (by tapping again on the "
"beginning of your highlight or on this <span class=\"ui\">highlighting icon</"
"span>)."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_orange\">Ikona zvýrazňovania</span> Táto ikona sa "
"zobrazí, keď ste v <span class=\"ui\">režime výberu a zvýrazňovania</span>. "
"KOReader má dodatočný režim zvýrazňovania, ktorý vám umožňuje spustiť "
"zvýrazňovanie a otáčať strany, aby ste vytvorili dlhé zvýraznenia, ktoré "
"môžu zahŕňať viacero strán. O tom si môžete prečítať v časti <a "
"href=\"#bookmarks\">ZÁLOŽKY, ZVYRAZŇOVANIE A POZNÁMKY</a> v tejto príručke. "
"Keď v tomto režime spustíte zvýrazňovanie, v rohu sa zobrazí táto ikona, "
"ktorá vám pripomenie, že ste stále v režime zvýrazňovania. Zmizne, keď "
"dokončíte zvýraznenie <b>výberom konca pasáže</b> alebo keď <b>zrušíte "
"zvýraznenie</b> (opätovným ťuknutím na začiatok zvýraznenia alebo na túto "
"<span class=\"ui\">ikonu zvýraznenia</span>)."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2006-12
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"label_orange\">Pokemon ball icon</span> This icon shows up "
#| "when you press for a long time on a word (intentionally or accidentally). "
#| "KOReader has a normal <b>long press</b> menu. And an additional <b>very "
#| "long press</b> menu when you hold your finger longer than 3 seconds. This "
#| "icon means that you activated this very long press menu."
msgid ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">Pokemon ball icon</span> This icon shows up when "
"you press for a long time on a word (intentionally or accidentally). "
"KOReader has a normal <b>long press</b> menu. And an additional <b>very long "
"press</b> menu when you hold your finger longer than 3 seconds. This icon "
"means that you activated this very long press menu."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_orange\">Ikona Pokémonovej lopty</span> Táto ikona sa "
"zobrazí, keď dlho stlačíte slovo (úmyselne alebo náhodne). KOReader má "
"normálne menu s <b>dlhým stlačením</b>. A ďalšie menu s <b>veľmi dlhým "
"stlačením</b>, keď podržíte prst dlhšie ako 3 sekundy. Táto ikona znamená, "
"že ste toto menu s veľmi dlhým stlačením aktivovali."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2016-12
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"label_orange\">Flip mode icon</span> This icon shows up "
#| "when you tap the top left corner if:"
msgid ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">Flip mode icon</span> This icon shows up when you "
"tap the top left corner if:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_orange\">Ikona režimu prevrátenia</span> Táto ikona sa "
"zobrazí po ťuknutí na ľavý horný roh, ak:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:2019-9
msgid "You are reading a PDF document"
msgstr "Čítate PDF dokument"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:2020-9
msgid ""
"And you are in a zoomed in view other than 100% (column, row or manual) or "
"in the <span class=\"ui\">reflow mode</span>"
msgstr ""
"A nachádzate sa v priblíženom zobrazení inom ako 100 % (stĺpcové, riadkové "
"alebo manuálne) alebo v <span class=\"ui\">režime preformátovania</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2023-8
msgid ""
"This mode temporarily displays the full page without cropping, scaled to fit "
"your screen. You can turn the pages in this mode. To exit this mode, tap on "
"this icon."
msgstr ""
"V tomto režime sa dočasne zobrazí celá strana bez orezania, upravená tak, "
"aby sa zmestila na obrazovku. V tomto režime môžete strany otáčať. Ak chcete "
"tento režim ukončiť, ťuknite na túto ikonu."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2027-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Status bar"
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-statusbar"
msgid "3.3 Status bar"
msgstr "Stavový riadok"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2029-6
msgid ""
"KOReader have two status bars, a <span class=\"ui\">Bottom status bar</span> "
"which is enabled by default. And we have an <span class=\"ui\">Alt status "
"bar</span> which appears at the top of the page if you enable it. This <span "
"class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> is available only in reflowable documents "
"(epub, html, docx, rtf, txt…)."
msgstr ""
"KOReader má dva stavové riadky, <span class=\"ui\">dolný stavový riadok</"
"span>, ktorý je predvolene povolený. A máme <span class=\"ui\">alternatívny "
"stavový riadok</span>, ktorý sa zobrazí v hornej časti strany, ak ho "
"povolíte. Tento <span class=\"ui\">Alternatívny stavový riadok</span> je k "
"dispozícii iba v dokumentoch s možnosťou preformátovania (epub, html, docx, "
"rtf, txt…)."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2034-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Bottom status bar</span> is the newer one which is "
"actively maintained. <span class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> is a remnant "
"from earlier versions of KOReader so we are not adding new features to it. "
"But you can still enable this <span class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> if "
"you find it useful. You can enable it from:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Spodný stavový riadok</span> je novší, ktorý sa aktívne "
"udržiava. <span class=\"ui\">Alternatívny stavový riadok</span> je "
"pozostatok z predchádzajúcich verzií KOReaderu, takže doňho nepridávame nové "
"funkcie. Tento <span class=\"ui\">alternatívny stavový riadok</span> však "
"stále môžete povoliť, ak ho považujete za užitočný. Môžete ho povoliť z:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2039-6
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Alt Status Bar"
msgstr ""
"SPODNÉ MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Alternatívny stavový riadok"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2042-6
msgid ""
"You can configure the <span class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> from this "
"menu:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Alternatívny stavový riadok</span> môžete nakonfigurovať "
"z tejto ponuky:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2045-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+html.body.div.div:1627-5"
#| msgid ""
#| "TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
#| "style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Alt status bar"
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+userinterface.div:146-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Alt status bar"
msgstr ""
"VRCHNÉ MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Stavový riadok / Alternatívny stavový riadok"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2048-6
msgid ""
"Instructions in the rest of this section are for the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Bottom status bar</span>."
msgstr ""
"Pokyny v zvyšku tejto časti sa týkajú <span class=\"ui\">Spodného stavového "
"riadku</span>."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2050-6
msgid "Chapter progress bar"
msgstr "Ukazovateľ priebehu kapitoly"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2052-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Progress bar</span> in the <span class=\"ui\">status bar</"
"span> normally shows your progress for the whole book. But it can also show "
"your progress for the <b>current chapter</b> instead. This can be useful for "
"example, if a book has lots of short chapters. In this case it might be hard "
"to see your progress in the current chapter so <span class=\"ui\">chapter "
"status bar</span> can be more informative here. You can enable the feature "
"from this menu:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Indikátor priebehu</span> v <span class=\"ui\">stavovom "
"riadku</span> zvyčajne zobrazuje váš postup v celej knihe. Môže však "
"zobrazovať aj postup v <b>aktuálnej kapitole</b>. Toto môže byť užitočné "
"napríklad, ak má kniha veľa krátkych kapitol. V takom prípade môže byť ťažké "
"vidieť váš postup v aktuálnej kapitole, takže <span class=\"ui\">stavový "
"riadok kapitoly</span> môže byť v tomto prípade informatívnejší. Túto "
"funkciu môžete povoliť z tejto ponuky:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2058-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
#| "style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Progress Bar / Show chapter-"
#| "progress bar instead"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Progress bar / Show chapter-progress "
"bar instead"
msgstr ""
"VRCHNÉ MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Stavový riadok / Ukazovateľ priebehu / Zobraziť "
"namiesto toho ukazovateľ priebehu kapitoly"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2061-6
msgid ""
"Also you can assign a gesture to switch between normal and chapter progress "
"bars. You can find this action under:"
msgstr ""
"Taktiež môžete priradiť gesto na prepínanie medzi normálnym a postupným "
"ukazovateľom kapitoly. Túto akciu nájdete pod:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2063-6
msgid "Gesture selection menu / Reader / Toggle chapter progress bar"
msgstr ""
"Menu výberu gest / Režim čítania / Prepínanie indikátora priebehu kapitoly"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2065-6
msgid "Configuring the status bar"
msgstr "Konfigurácia stavového riadka"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2067-6
msgid ""
"You can configure the bottom status bar from this menu. Feel free to explore "
"the <span class=\"ui\">SETTINGS</span> sub-menu to customize your status bar "
"as you like."
msgstr ""
"Z tejto ponuky môžete nakonfigurovať spodný stavový riadok. Neváhajte a "
"preskúmajte podponuku <span class=\"ui\">NASTAVENIA</span> na prispôsobenie "
"stavového riadku, ako chcete."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2070-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar"
